Package: ca-certificates-mozilla
Name: CA Certificates (Mozilla)
Version: 20261106
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Section: System
Priority: optional
Provides: ca-certificates
Replaces: ca-certificates
Conflicts: ca-certificates
Maintainer: tslmy
Author: Mozilla (bundle), packaged by tslmy
Description: Current Mozilla root certificates for curl, wget and git
 Installs /etc/ssl/certs/cacert.pem, the Mozilla CA bundle as curl ships it.
 Old jailbreak bundles from 2019 and earlier lack newer roots, so HTTPS sites
 fail verification. Replaces the ca-certificates package; it has its own name
 because Bingner's repo pins ca-certificates at priority 1001, which would
 downgrade this bundle. The version is the date of the bundle.
